# Copied to .gitattributes by /structure (or /foundation when it is missing). Pins LF for every text file, so a
# Windows checkout builds the same image as CI: a Dockerfile, justfile or shell script with CRLF fails inside a
# Linux container. A logged run spent calls converting line endings by hand because this file was missing.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
